      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW MITCH (7) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish second (22.37) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Rates highly and will give a great sight. PAW MURBELLA (2) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at Warrnambool over 390m behind Kensington Flyer (23.20) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Should be thereabouts. LEROY'S GIRL (1) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 650m behind Slick Nitro (38.00) in a Grade 5. Form from her last run is proving strong. Should be in this for a long way. JUST QUICKLY (3) should be thereabouts.",
